    "Static source-path evidence, not a measured encoder-hit counter or a new GPU run.",
    "Only disabling one of the two cache settings does not trigger the request-unique UUID branch.",
    "Direct/custom preprocessed EngineInput routes that bypass normal renderer MM processing are outside this conclusion."
